license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShuyaoGao/text-to-3d-world"
url: "https://ShuyaoGao.github.io/text-to-3d-world/play/"
abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): a Chinese sentence is parsed by a keyword
  rule engine into a JSON scene plan (objects, counts, directions, relative positions, colours,
  sizes) and built in three.js from primitive shapes with seeded rejection sampling. A live
  understanding panel shows every step; four rule levels start from the original keyword engine.
  The original page that can call a large language model is kept as app/index_full.html.
keywords:
  - course-demo
  - threejs
  - procedural-generation
  - rule-based-nlp
